=== 3. POST /students/save : ajout d'un etudiant ===
PS> curl.exe -s -X POST http://localhost:8080/students/save -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d @docs/payloads/etudiant.json
{
  "nom": "ALAOUI",
  "prenom": "Imane",
  "dateNaissance": "2002-05-17",
  "email": "imane.alaoui@toubkalit.ma",
  "filiere": "Genie Informatique"
}
{"id":9,"nom":"ALAOUI","prenom":"Imane","dateNaissance":"2002-05-17","email":"imane.alaoui@toubkalit.ma","filiere":"Genie Informatique","nomComplet":"ALAOUI Imane"}
[HTTP 201]

=== 4. GET /students/9 : consultation de l'etudiant cree ===
PS> curl.exe -s http://localhost:8080/students/9
{"id":9,"nom":"ALAOUI","prenom":"Imane","dateNaissance":"2002-05-17","email":"imane.alaoui@toubkalit.ma","filiere":"Genie Informatique","nomComplet":"ALAOUI Imane"}
[HTTP 200]

=== 5. GET /students/count apres ajout ===
PS> curl.exe -s http://localhost:8080/students/count
9
[HTTP 200]

=== 6. GET /students/byYear : repartition par annee de naissance ===
PS> curl.exe -s http://localhost:8080/students/byYear
[[1998,1],[1999,1],[2000,2],[2001,2],[2002,2],[2003,1]]
[HTTP 200]

=== 7. POST /students/save : donnees invalides (validation Jakarta) ===
PS> curl.exe -s -X POST http://localhost:8080/students/save -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d @docs/payloads/etudiant-invalide.json
{"horodatage":"2026-11-02T18:09:52.900685800","statut":400,"erreur":"Bad Request","message":"Certaines donnees sont invalides","chemin":"/students/save","champsInvalides":{"filiere":"La filiere est obligatoire","dateNaissance":"La date de naissance doit etre dans le passe","email":"L'adresse e-mail n'est pas valide","nom":"Le nom est obligatoire"}}
[HTTP 400]

=== 8. GET /students/999 : identifiant inexistant ===
PS> curl.exe -s http://localhost:8080/students/999
{"horodatage":"2026-11-02T18:09:52.983345600","statut":404,"erreur":"Not Found","message":"Aucun etudiant ne correspond a l'identifiant 999","chemin":"/students/999"}
[HTTP 404]

