=== 11. DELETE /students/delete/9 : suppression puis deuxieme appel ===
PS> curl.exe -s -X DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/delete/9

[HTTP 204]

PS> curl.exe -s -X DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/delete/9

[HTTP 404]

=== 12. Documentation OpenAPI generee par springdoc ===
PS> curl.exe -s http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs | ConvertFrom-Json | Select-Object -ExpandProperty paths | Get-Member -MemberType NoteProperty | Select-Object -ExpandProperty Name | Where-Object { $_ -like '/students*' }
/students/all
/students/byYear
/students/count
/students/delete/{id}
/students/save
/students/search
/students/statistiques
/students/{id}

